<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - i2 Tech upgraded.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - i2 Tech upgraded.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Everen said it upgraded i2 Technologies Inc to near-term outperform from market perform.</p>
<p>-- said the long-term rating remains an outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- i2 gained 1/8 to 33-1/8.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
